{
  "$defs": {
    "CohortDims": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "粗粒度分组维度。**只有这三项**——细到专业方向以下就可能反查到个人。\n\n三个字段都是**受约束类型**，不是自由文本。此前 ``school`` 与\n``development_mode`` 是裸 ``str``，于是\n``school=\"ENGG/COMP/AI-track/2024-intake/GPA3.7-3.8\"`` 完全合法——\n§17.1.2 要求\"仅粗粒度分组、不含专业方向以下的细分\"，\n而把细分塞进一个字符串既绕过了这条，也绕过了维度层数限制。",
      "properties": {
        "development_mode": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DevelopmentModeType",
          "description": "用枚举而非自由文本。枚举本来就存在，此前只是没接上"
        },
        "school": {
          "description": "学院代码，例如 'ENGG'。限制成短代码，塞不下更细的分层",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z]{2,6}$",
          "title": "School",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "year_level": {
          "maximum": 8,
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Year Level",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "school",
        "year_level",
        "development_mode"
      ],
      "title": "CohortDims",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DevelopmentModeType": {
      "enum": [
        "employment",
        "academia",
        "entrepreneurship",
        "personal_interest",
        "exploration"
      ],
      "title": "DevelopmentModeType",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "DimensionRating": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "dimension": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QualityDimension"
        },
        "rating": {
          "maximum": 5,
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Rating",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "dimension",
        "rating"
      ],
      "title": "DimensionRating",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "FitTag": {
      "description": "区分\"活动不好\"与\"对我不合适\"（Spec §17.4 Personal-vs-Global Separation）。",
      "enum": [
        "too_basic_for_me",
        "too_advanced_for_me",
        "wrong_format_for_me",
        "schedule_mismatch",
        "good_fit"
      ],
      "title": "FitTag",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "QualityDimension": {
      "description": "固定维度。新增维度要改 Spec，不能由前端随手加一个自由文本问题。",
      "enum": [
        "content_depth",
        "organization",
        "practical_value",
        "networking_value",
        "expectation_match"
      ],
      "title": "QualityDimension",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://campuspath.invalid/schema/EventQualityFeedback.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "A1 → Aggregation Service 的唯一载荷（Spec §8.9.2）。\n\n**没有 student_id，没有自由文本。** 这两条由字段列表 + ``extra=\"forbid\"``\n+ ``tests/test_boundary_guards.py`` 的字段名扫描三重保证。",
  "properties": {
    "cohort_dims": {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CohortDims"
    },
    "dimensions": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DimensionRating"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Dimensions",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "feedback_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Feedback Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "fit_tags": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FitTag"
      },
      "title": "Fit Tags",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "occurrence_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Occurrence Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "series_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Series Id"
    },
    "submitted_at": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Submitted At",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "verification_ref": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "pattern": "^ver_[0-9a-f]{16,64}$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "出勤验证的**不透明**凭据。刻意不叫 evidence_id——指向学生 Evidence 的 id 会把聚合域重新连回个人。改名只是把字段从扫描器眼前挪走；正则才让「不透明」这件事可校验：EV-STUDENT-S001-transcript 这种串现在会被拒",
      "title": "Verification Ref"
    },
    "verified_attendance": {
      "title": "Verified Attendance",
      "type": "boolean"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "feedback_id",
    "occurrence_id",
    "verified_attendance",
    "dimensions",
    "cohort_dims",
    "submitted_at"
  ],
  "title": "EventQualityFeedback",
  "type": "object"
}
